From: Petros Piki <pet.piki@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 22:18:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add HR & Administration module, system-based audit
 workpapers, and configurable permissions

- New HR & Administration section: Policies & Procedures library,
  in-app timesheets (with overtime calc and an Excel upload option),
  a staffing planner (audit timetable + allocation grid), and a
  firm-wide project/task board.
- New system-based audit workpapers on each engagement: Risk
  Assessment questionnaire, Understanding the Entity prompts,
  Analytical Review with automatic variance flagging, a Materiality
  calculator, and Trial Balance import (xlsx/csv) feeding IAS 1
  Financial Statements with audit adjustments.
- Every workpaper above gets Preparer/Reviewer/Partner sign-off,
  with reviewers and partners always distinct from the preparer.
- New configurable role-permissions system (Team > Permissions) so
  an admin can delegate specific administrative actions per role
  instead of them being hardcoded.
- Supporting template/UI updates and refreshed README documentation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dq9HgqbdeP7FfLVNZ4DSAc
